/T (Methodology  The implementation and validation of the Intelligent Graph-ML Hybrid Architecture \(IGMH\) follows a rigorous multi-stage methodology designed for a 2-node IoT simulation environment. This methodology encompasses the mathematical formulation of the graph structures, the integration of machine learning models for key management and threat detection, and the evaluation of the system's performance across various metrics. )
