<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 341 0 R
/T (Moving forward, the strategic focus for cryptography experts and IoT architects must shift toward "crypto-agility" and structural security. The structural complexity of Index Difference Graphs provides a formidable barrier to the "Harvest Now, Decrypt Later" strategy, ensuring that data remains confidential even as quantum computing capabilities expand. Furthermore, the continuous improvement of machine learning models for real-time threat detection will ensure that IoT ecosystems can autonomously adapt to an increasingly hostile cyber landscape, safeguarding the privacy, integrity, and availability of the global connected infrastructure. )
/E (Moving forward, the strategic focus for cryptography experts and IoT architects must shift toward "crypto-agility" and structural security. The structural complexity of Index Difference Graphs provides a formidable barrier to the "Harvest Now, Decrypt Later" strategy, ensuring that data remains confidential even as quantum computing capabilities expand. Furthermore, the continuous improvement of machine learning models for real-time threat detection will ensure that IoT ecosystems can autonomously adapt to an increasingly hostile cyber landscape, safeguarding the privacy, integrity, and availability of the global connected infrastructure. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
