1148 0 obj
<<
/Title (Conclusion  The evolution of the Internet of Things has brought the industry to a critical crossroad where the proliferation of edge devices has outpaced the development of secure, efficient, and quantum-ready cryptographic standards. This research report has demonstrated that the synthesis of graph-theoretic structural labeling and machine learning-driven adaptive defense offers a powerful solution to this dilemma. The Index Difference Graph \(IDG\) and the associated IDMC algorithm provide a revolutionary alternative to traditional block ciphers, achieving linear O\(n\) complexity and immense brute-force resistance by treating graph topology as a mathematical secret key.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1228 0 R
/Next 527 0 R
>>
endobj
