/Title (The emergence of the Index Difference Graph \(IDG\) in 2025 represents a critical advancement in this structural approach. Unlike conventional additive or multiplicative labeling methods, IDG incorporates vertex positions into the secret key generation process, ensuring that both the sender and receiver must possess the precise topological map of the graph to facilitate successful decryption. This approach aligns with the principles of Zero Trust Architecture, where no implicit trust is granted to any entity within the network, and communication is verified through continuous authentication and adaptive security measures.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1338 0 R
/Next 1342 0 R
>>
endobj
