/Title (Problem Statement  The fundamental crisis in IoT security stems from a radical asymmetry between the capabilities of modern attackers and the defensive resources available to embedded devices. As of 2024, approximately 70% of IoT devices exhibit significant vulnerabilities, ranging from unpatched firmware and weak authentication to the complete absence of encryption for telemetry data. This vulnerability is compounded by several critical factors that render traditional security models inadequate for current and future deployments.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1342 0 R
/Next 1346 0 R
>>
