/Title (The "Harvest Now, Decrypt Later" threat model adds a temporal dimension to the problem. Adversaries are currently intercepting and archiving encrypted data with the expectation that future quantum computers, utilizing algorithms like Shor's or Grover's, will be able to break classical asymmetric and symmetric encryptions. This necessitates the immediate adoption of post-quantum robust or structurally complex encryption methods that do not rely solely on the hardness of integer factorization or discrete logarithms.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1348 0 R
/Next 1352 0 R
>>
