/Title (Proposed Solution: The Intelligent Graph-ML Hybrid Architecture \(IGMH\)  To address the multifaceted security challenges of IoT, this research proposes the Intelligent Graph-ML Hybrid Architecture \(IGMH\). The IGMH framework is designed to provide end-to-end security for 2-node IoT network communications by combining the structural innovation of the Index Difference Modular Cryptography \(IDMC\) algorithm with the adaptive intelligence of neural networks and the dynamic uncertainty of moving target defense. The solution focuses on three key pillars: structural graph-based key representation, intelligent anomaly detection, and adaptive crypto-agility.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1352 0 R
/Next 1356 0 R
>>
endobj
