/Title (Data synthesized from. The analysis indicates that while AES-128 provides strong security, its round-based structure on resource-constrained devices without dedicated hardware accelerators. In contrast, the IDMC algorithm achieves high security through the structural complexity of the graph labeling, but with  a much simpler modular operation that executes in sub-millisecond time.)
